{"reviews":[{"id":"B01L71F5XW-0","r":5.0,"t":"Mommy and me &lt;3","x":"These are Amazing!!! And my daughter loves them to! Super soft and adjustable! We tied ours in the back for a different look!","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-1","r":5.0,"t":"Love! Soft and cute \u2764\ufe0f","x":"These are great. We got them a couple weeks ago and have wore all but one so far.  I really like that you tie them yourself so they will fit baby for awhile.  My only issue is my ability to tie a cute knot but that's more on me than the item.  I also love how soft they are. Comfortable for baby to wear and me too!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-2","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect and cute!","x":"These head bands are adorable! I love them so much. I was looking for something cute to match for me and my 4 month old daughter and this was the perfect thing. You tie them yourself so it fits yours and your little ones heads just right.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-3","r":5.0,"t":"Adorable and so soft","x":"Adorable! I love the super soft fabric and the quality stitching. I did not realize these were not stitctched to appear to be tied,  which I really like- Mommy actually ties it to create a custom fit for their baby\u2019s head. Perfect!!! Hope to see more sets, specifically solid colors (pastels, primary colors, neons) My daughter and daughter in law love them.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-4","r":3.0,"t":"3 stars because...","x":"For those of us unable to tie a &#34;cute&#34; knot, I'd recommend the ones that are already tied. Soft fabric and a good price compared to similar items.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-5","r":5.0,"t":"Love!!","x":"Super cute and soft! I love they grow with us. My daughter is 6 months and I'm glad we can match \u2764","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-6","r":5.0,"t":"Cute buy","x":"Cute, simple and stretchy, we love them.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-7","r":3.0,"t":"Cute but not the softest material","x":"These are adorable. Adjustable because you tie the knot/bow yourself. Prints are great. The only reason it\u2019s not 5 stars is because the buffalo plaid was super soft material but the others were not- a bit stiffer and perhaps scratchy? I wish they were all as soft as the plaid especially if going on a baby\u2019s head.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great fit, good quality.","x":"These headbands are so great! The quality is good and they are sized accurately. My daughter is 10 months old and there is room to grow in the headband. The headbands come untied, which is great for adjusting to different head sizes. I'd definitely order these again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-9","r":5.0,"t":"Pretty patterns, I get so many compliments on these!","x":"These are super cute!  I get so many compliments when I wear these with my daughter. They stretch really well. They don\u2019t come tied though, which some people may not like. You have to do it yourself!  But it fit my newborn and I can see it fitting her for a while!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-10","r":5.0,"t":"They're great quality and easy to use","x":"Bought as a gift for a friend who loves headbands - she adores them! They're great quality and easy to use!  Love that you tie them yourself so that they're adjustable for your head and baby's head!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-11","r":5.0,"t":"Very Nice Item","x":"Purchased for daughter & baby, this is the cutest thing Mommy & Baby and can be used for many years, can be adjusted for baby as she gets older! Very Happy with my purchase!   Thank You Amazon","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-12","r":5.0,"t":"Love them!","x":"I bought these a while ago and I\u2019m still very happy about my purchase! I like them when I can simply tie and untie, which is very flexible in size especially for a growing baby!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-13","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality, super cute headbands.","x":"Made with really nice stretchy material and my wife and daughter look so cute in their matching head ware. Does take a little time to ship from China but only a few weeks.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-14","r":3.0,"t":"Pretty cute","x":"These aren't cotton, some kind of stretchy fabric. Also they aren't tied, you have to figure it out. I've never been able to make it look like the pictures.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great Gift","x":"Gave this as a gift for my niece and her little one. She loved it so much,  they asked for all the details of the purchase so they can try to buy more!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-16","r":5.0,"t":"The headbands are adorable! I appreciate that they can be tied to ...","x":"The headbands are adorable! I appreciate that they can be tied to fit any sized head. The black & red headband is made from especially soft material.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-17","r":5.0,"t":"Good Fit","x":"These are so cute! It was a little confusing to tie at first but once I looked at the picture again it was easy! Definitely cute on little girls! \ud83d\ude0d","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-18","r":5.0,"t":"Good Fit","x":"These are so cute! It was a little confusing to tie at first but once I looked at the picture again it was easy! Definitely cute on little girls! \ud83d\ude0d","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-19","r":5.0,"t":"Adorable Mommy/Me gift!","x":"Adorable Mommy/Daughter gift. All bands are self tied so very much adjustable for size and comfort level. Loved taking pictures with my daughter.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-20","r":5.0,"t":"Grows with baby","x":"Since you tie it on your own it will grow with her compared to some headbands that are sewn together and she is either to small or too big for.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-21","r":5.0,"t":"Fits NB and up","x":"These look so cute! I would definitely buy them again. I like that it's not one size. You can adjust as baby grows","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-22","r":5.0,"t":"So far they look nice in the package as color n fabric","x":"Bought them for baby shower. So far they look nice in the package as color n fabric. Not sure about fit or last.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-23","r":5.0,"t":"Love these!!!","x":"Loves these headbands. We get lots of comments when we wear them and they are adjustable which is the best part","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B01L71F5XW-24","r":4.0,"t":"Super cute","x":"My cousin loves matching with her daughter and she loved this for christmas! Fits well and looks so cute!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the headbands as cute and soft, with many praising the fabric's comfort.","cites":[1,2,3,4,6,7,10,14]},{"text":"Many customers appreciate that the headbands come untied so they can be adjusted to fit both mom and baby as the child grows.","cites":[1,2,3,4,6,9,10,11,12,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers note that the headbands arrive untied and require you to tie a cute knot yourself, which can be difficult.","cites":[2,5,10,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention inconsistency in fabric softness, with some prints being softer than others or stiffer/scratchy.","cites":[8,15]},{"text":"Several customers praise the quality, stretchiness, and accurate sizing of the headbands.","cites":[4,7,9,11,14]}]},"qa":[]}